  "prompt": "For each plan, find the longest gap between two consecutive payments of one subscription on that plan, in days: the UTC date of a payment minus the UTC date of the same subscription's payment before it (paid_at holds UTC time). Only payments that were not refunded count; refunded payments are left out before the gaps are measured. A subscription with fewer than two such payments has no gap, and a plan with no gap at all is left out. Return plan_name and max_gap_days. Any row order is fine.",
